OL,3,ACanada welcomes EU ambition for it to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member', Carney tells
OL,5,AEuropean Parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Mark Carney says "Europe and Canada
OL,8,Fare stronger together" in a speech to
OL,9,Fthe European Parliament
OL,11,FHe also says he "welcomes" the EU's
OL,12,F"ambition" for Canada to become an
OL,13,Fassociate member of the bloc
OL,15,FCarney says a Canada-EU alliance would
OL,16,Fbe a "beacon for other democracies"
