OL,3,ACanada welcomes EU ambition for it to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member', Carney tells
OL,5,AEuropean Parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FEuropean Commission President Ursula
OL,8,Fvon der Leyen made the suggestion of
OL,9,FCanada becoming an "associate member"
OL,10,Fof the EU on Wednesday, saying "we must
OL,11,Furgently re-imagine our partnerships" -
OL,12,Fwhat is an EU 'associate member'?
OL,14,FUS President Donald Trump reacted by
OL,15,Fthreatening tariffs on Europe and
OL,16,Fcalling it "laughable"
OL,18,FThe US recently increased tariffs on
OL,19,FCanadian goods, with Canada responding
OL,20,Fwith tariffs of its own
